    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of DOOT is legend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doot must return to the past to STOP MOTHER GATOR from hosting her INTERGALACTIC HOOTENANNY and, time permitting, DESTROYING HUMANITY </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of Doot, a time-traveling, blood-lustful Chihuahua from the distant future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is DOOT-TYPE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cinematic Cut Scenes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Game Commentary by the Developer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cheats To Mix Up Gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Special Modes </p></li></ul>",
